    "spoken": "So imagine the night Betelgeuse explodes. The first sign would not be light at all. It would be a flood of ghostly particles called neutrinos streaming out of the collapsing core. Then the light arrives. Within days, Betelgeuse would blaze as bright as the moon at half phase. You could see it in broad daylight.",
